@startuml
title Arquitetura do protótipo (Monolito Modular Django, SSR) - WFM Atacadão
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false

node "Terminal da loja\n(navegador, sem JS)" as Client

node "Infraestrutura web" {
  component "Gunicorn\n(WSGI)\n+ WhiteNoise (estáticos)" as WSGI
}

package "Projeto Django (config)" {
  component "URL dispatcher\n(config/urls.py)" as URLs
  component "Middlewares\n(sessão, CSRF, auth, messages)" as Middleware

  package "Módulos de negócio (apps/)" {
    component "core\nFilial, Setor, Cargo, Terminal\nhome, diretório (RS18)" as Core
    component "accounts\nFuncionario, login CPF/matrícula\nRS01-RS03" as Accounts
    component "tarefas\nRS04, RS05, RS10, RS13" as Tarefas
    component "escalas\nRS06, RS07, RS11, RS12, RS17" as Escalas
    component "ponto\nRS09, RS14 (log imutável)" as Ponto
    component "comunicacao\nRS08, RS15, RS16" as Comunic
  }

  component "Camada de serviços\n(services.py de cada módulo:\nregras de negócio testáveis)" as Services
  component "Templates Django (SSR)\n+ CSS único" as Templates
}

database "PostgreSQL 16\n(SQLite no início rápido)" as DB

Client -down-> WSGI : HTTP(S)
WSGI -down-> Middleware : Request
Middleware -down-> URLs
URLs -down-> Accounts
URLs -down-> Tarefas
URLs -down-> Escalas
URLs -down-> Ponto
URLs -down-> Comunic
URLs -down-> Core
Accounts ..> Services
Tarefas ..> Services
Escalas ..> Services
Ponto ..> Services
Comunic ..> Services
Services -down-> DB : Django ORM
Accounts -right-> Templates : render
note bottom of Services
  Dependências entre módulos (setas de código):
  escalas -> comunicacao (notificação do remanejamento)
  tarefas, escalas, ponto, comunicacao -> accounts, core
  core.home compõe dados de tarefas/escalas/ponto
end note
@enduml
